  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "MMPR-v1.2",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMMPR-v1.2\n\t\n\n[\ud83d\udcc2 GitHub] | [\ud83c\udf10 Project Page] | [\ud83d\udcdc Paper (InternVL3.5)] | [\ud83d\udcdc Paper (MMPR/MPO)] | [\ud83c\udd95 Blog (MPO)] | [\ud83d\udcd6 Documents]\nThis is a newer version of MMPR and MMPR-v1.1, which includes additional data sources to enhance the data diversity and greatly improves the overall performance of InternVL3.5 across all scales. The prompts used to build this dataset is released in MMPR-v1.2-prompts.\nTo unzip the archive of images, please first run cat images.zip_* > images.zip and then run\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenGVLab/MMPR-v1.2.",
  "alternateName": [
